# For the API project, which deploys from the repository root.
#
# The function needs api/, core/, agent/, tools/, llm/, knowledge/, actions/,
# metrics/ and mcp_server/. Everything listed here is either a different
# deployment or a laptop-only tool, and shipping it only enlarges the bundle
# and the surface. Nothing here is imported on the request path -- there is a
# test (test_requirements_covers_every_runtime_import) that walks the actual
# import graph of the runtime packages, so this list cannot quietly drop
# something the function needs.
#
# The FRONTEND project sets web/ as its root directory, so this file does not
# apply to it.

web/
tests/
docs/
eval/
seed/
scripts/
db/migrations/
.venv/
.pytest_cache/
*.egg-info/

# Generated seed data. Large, regenerable, and never read at runtime -- the
# corpus the API queries lives in Postgres, not on disk.
seed/out/
